text I'm not looking for it! I thought we were just calling it "Codename: Potty" despite what I'm actually looking for!
setvar strS[1001] = "CGAK15PT"
setvar intF[1113] = intF[1112]
bgload {$strS[1000]}.jpg 0
setimg CGAK15PT.png
if intF[1113] == 1
	if strS[1000] < "C"
		setimg {$strS[1004]}.png -7 -7
	fi
fi
sound KL3.aac
text @[Akio]
text What do you mean? That doesn't make any sense! If it's "Codename: Potty," then of course you'd be looking for a potty!
text @[Tomoya]
text It's a CODE name!
sound KL4.aac
text @[Akio]
text Whaa? A codename?! What's that supposed to mean? Are you making fun of me, kid?!
text @[Tomoya]
text You're the one who named it that, old man!
setvar strS[1001] = "CGAK16PT"
setvar intF[1113] = intF[1112]
bgload {$strS[1000]}.jpg 0
setimg CGAK16PT.png
if intF[1113] == 1
	if strS[1000] < "C"
		setimg {$strS[1004]}.png -7 -7
	fi
fi
sound KL5.aac
text @[Akio]
text You're really going to piss me off at this rate, punk!!!
music BGM08A.mp3
setvar strS[1001] = "NONE"
setvar intF[1113] = intF[1112]
bgload {$strS[1000]}.jpg 0
if intF[1113] == 1
	if strS[1000] < "C"
		setimg {$strS[1004]}.png -7 -7
	fi
fi
sound KL6.aac
text @[Voice]
text It's late at night, boys. Please keep your voices down, okay?
text Sanae-san's words float to our ears.
setvar strS[1001] = "CGAK26PT"
setvar intF[1113] = intF[1112]
bgload {$strS[1000]}.jpg 30
setimg CGAK26PT.png
if intF[1113] == 1
	if strS[1000] < "C"
		setimg {$strS[1004]}.png -7 -7
	fi
fi
sound KL7.aac
text @[Akio]
text Be quiet, stupid! You'll wake Nagisa up.
text @[Tomoya]
text You're one to talk...
setvar strS[1001] = "NONE"
setvar intF[1113] = intF[1112]
bgload {$strS[1000]}.jpg 30
if intF[1113] == 1
	if strS[1000] < "C"
		setimg {$strS[1004]}.png -7 -7
	fi
fi
text It'd be a miracle if she didn't wake up after all of that.
text The old man walks down the hallway in a meaningless tiptoe.
text I follow after him.
setvar strS[1000] = "KURO"
setvar intA[1000] = 1
if intA[1000] == 0
	goto s17
fi
goto 19
label s17
setvar strS[1000] = ""
label 19
setvar strS[1001] = "NONE"
setvar intF[1113] = intF[1112]
bgload {$strS[1000]}.jpg 88
if intF[1113] == 1
	if strS[1000] < "C"
		setimg {$strS[1004]}.png -7 -7
	fi
fi
sound KL8.aac
text @[Akio]
text Phew. We're here.
sound KL9.aac
text @[Akio]
text Time to put Codename: Potty into action!
text He seems to have remembered giving this plan its codename.
text @[Tomoya]
text Just so we're clear, I'm not looking for a toddler toilet.
sound KLA.aac
text @[Akio]
text Wait, really?
text @[Tomoya]
text I told you earlier. There's a story that Nagisa heard when she was little that she barely remembers.
text @[Tomoya]
text There's a chance that it's in a book somewhere, so that's what I'm looking for.
sound KLB.aac
text @[Akio]
text A book...? I've got a lot of books. That's gonna be annoying.
sound KLC.aac
text @[Akio]
text I wouldn't say I have ten thousand books, but I probably have nearly a thousand.
text @[Tomoya]
text A thousand what?
sound KLD.aac
text @[Akio]
text Porno magazines.
text @[Tomoya]
text ...
sound KLE.aac
text @[Akio]
text You'd better keep that a secret from Sanae, punk.
music ~
text The two of us search until it's nearly dawn, but in the end, we can't find a single picture book.
music BGM08D.mp3
sound KLF.aac
text @[Akio]
text You know what it probably is? It was probably taking up space, so I threw it out.
text It feels like he had plenty of other things that took up space that were less important, though.
text Then again, I don't know how many families actually take good care of their children's picture books.
sound KLG.aac
text @[Akio]
text Are you happy now?
text @[Tomoya]
text ...
sound KLH.aac
text @[Akio]
text Cheer up. I'll give you some of those porno mags I was telling you about.
text @[Tomoya]
text I don't want them...
sound KLI.aac
text @[Akio]
text Tsk... You sure are ungrateful, you know that?
sound KLJ.aac
text @[Akio]
text In any case, let's go to bed for now. You've got school tomorrow, don't you? You're going to oversleep at this rate.
text @[Tomoya]
text Oh, I guess I do...
text With no other option, I'm forced to give up for the night.
music ~
setvar strS[1000] = "KURO"
setvar intA[1000] = 1
if intA[1000] == 0
	goto s18
fi
goto 20
label s18
setvar strS[1000] = ""
label 20
setvar strS[1001] = "NONE"
setvar intF[1113] = intF[1112]
bgload {$strS[1000]}.jpg 98
if intF[1113] == 1
	if strS[1000] < "C"
		setimg {$strS[1004]}.png -7 -7
	fi
fi
jump SEEN6506_0_0.scr
